<title>INDIA: India's DSP Merrill Lynch Net Asset Value on funds.</title>
<headline>India's DSP Merrill Lynch Net Asset Value on funds.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's DSP Merrill Lynch said on Thursday the net asset value it's schemes as of June 19, 1997 is as follows:</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>    Name of the fund     NAV   Purchase Price     Sale Price</p>
<p>    ----------------     ---   --------------     -----------</p>
<p>    BOND FUND	     10.23	 10.23		10.23</p>
<p>(GROWTH OPTION)</p>
<p>    BOND FUND	     10.23	 10.23		10.23</p>
<p>(DIVIDEND OPTION)</p>
<p>    EQUTIY FUND	   10.96	 11.30		10.96</p>
<p>-</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22 265 9000</p>
